{"id":"676ac8d00a5a40c5","group":"56","path":"56/56-lem-proofterm-serialization.md","title":"证明项可串行化为具体有限归约","display":"lem-proofterm-serialization — 证明项可串行化为具体有限归约","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-lem-proofterm-serialization","aliases":["56-lem-proofterm-serialization"],"display":"lem-proofterm-serialization — 证明项可串行化为具体有限归约","depends_on":["[[56-df-proofterm-permutation]]","[[56-df-proofterm-embedding]]"],"source_section":"§8.3 Exercise 8.3.22; Proposition 8.3.21","source_printed_pages":"336–337","source_ocr_blocks":[357,358],"source_statement_status":"compared-to-local-djvu-ocr; typed-open-term-coding-local","source_proof_status":"local-structural-derivation-in-Remark; not-machine-formalized"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-lem-proofterm-serialization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-lem-proofterm-serialization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-proofterm-serialization — 证明项可串行化为具体有限归约"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"001b6ab17e88507e\" href=\"?note=001b6ab17e88507e\" title=\"56-df-proofterm-permutation\">56-df-proofterm-permutation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c273fed319bca9e3\" href=\"?note=c273fed319bca9e3\" title=\"56-df-proofterm-embedding\">56-df-proofterm-embedding</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§8.3 Exercise 8.3.22; Proposition 8.3.21"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"336–337"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>357</span><span>358</span></div>"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"compared-to-local-djvu-ocr; typed-open-term-coding-local"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"local-structural-derivation-in-Remark; not-machine-formalized"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>固定普通TRS，使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"001b6ab17e88507e\" href=\"?note=001b6ab17e88507e\" title=\"56-df-proofterm-permutation\">56-df-proofterm-permutation</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c273fed319bca9e3\" href=\"?note=c273fed319bca9e3\" title=\"56-df-proofterm-embedding\">56-df-proofterm-embedding</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\phi\\in\\operatorname{PT}_R\">\\(\\phi\\in\\operatorname{PT}_R\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho,\\eta\\in\\mathcal F_R\">\\(\\rho,\\eta\\in\\mathcal F_R\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{tgt}(\\rho)=\\operatorname{src}(\\eta)\">\\(\\operatorname{tgt}(\\rho)=\\operatorname{src}(\\eta)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists\\rho_\\phi\\in\\mathcal F_R\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{src}(\\rho_\\phi)=S_R(\\phi)\\land\\operatorname{tgt}(\\rho_\\phi)=T_R(\\phi)\\land\\operatorname{wit}_R(\\rho_\\phi)\\approx_R\\phi\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists\\rho_\\phi\\in\\mathcal F_R\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{src}(\\rho_\\phi)=S_R(\\phi)\\land\\operatorname{tgt}(\\rho_\\phi)=T_R(\\phi)\\land\\operatorname{wit}_R(\\rho_\\phi)\\approx_R\\phi\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{wit}_R(\\rho;\\eta)\\simeq_R\\operatorname{wit}_R(\\rho)\\bullet\\operatorname{wit}_R(\\eta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{wit}_R(\\rho;\\eta)\\simeq_R\\operatorname{wit}_R(\\rho)\\bullet\\operatorname{wit}_R(\\eta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是书8.3.22练习的本地结构归纳证明。变量构造取零步；函数构造先依次在各参数的固定上下文执行归纳所得路径，F方程和单位方程把其见证合成原函数证明项。规则构造先在左项的每个变量出现处串行执行相应子路径：左项重复变量时每个出现都执行，因各出现不交而得到l的模式实例化；再收缩根部规则，I方程给置换等价。规则无右变量新增保证该根步合法。组合构造直接拼接两条归纳路径；中间项由类型规则相等。这里不要求全系统终止，只把一棵有限证明树展开成有限路径。第二式对ρ长度归纳，使用结合与Id单位。未声称这种串行化唯一或长度不变。</p>\n<p>来源：用户提供的Terese (2003)本地DjVu；书页为印刷页，OCR块按U+001F从1编号。源文件及规范化文字哈希已与前轮重核。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-proofterm-permutation","status":"resolved","id":"001b6ab17e88507e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-proofterm-permutation]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-proofterm-embedding","status":"resolved","id":"c273fed319bca9e3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-proofterm-embedding]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-proofterm-permutation","status":"resolved","id":"001b6ab17e88507e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定普通TRS，使用 [[56-df-proofterm-permutation]]、[[56-df-proofterm-embedding]]。$\\phi\\in\\operatorname{PT}_R$，$\\rho,\\eta\\in\\mathcal F_R$，且 $\\operatorname{tgt}(\\rho)=\\operatorname{src}(\\eta)$。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-proofterm-embedding","status":"resolved","id":"c273fed319bca9e3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定普通TRS，使用 [[56-df-proofterm-permutation]]、[[56-df-proofterm-embedding]]。$\\phi\\in\\operatorname{PT}_R$，$\\rho,\\eta\\in\\mathcal F_R$，且 $\\operatorname{tgt}(\\rho)=\\operatorname{src}(\\eta)$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\phi\\in\\operatorname{PT}_R","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho,\\eta\\in\\mathcal F_R","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{tgt}(\\rho)=\\operatorname{src}(\\eta)","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists\\rho_\\phi\\in\\mathcal F_R\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{src}(\\rho_\\phi)=S_R(\\phi)\\land\\operatorname{tgt}(\\rho_\\phi)=T_R(\\phi)\\land\\operatorname{wit}_R(\\rho_\\phi)\\approx_R\\phi\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{wit}_R(\\rho;\\eta)\\simeq_R\\operatorname{wit}_R(\\rho)\\bullet\\operatorname{wit}_R(\\eta).","display":true}],"bytes":2165,"backlinks":[{"id":"68fa233ff6e9da6a","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{PT}_R,S_R,T_R,\\operatorname{Anc}_R$ 见 [[56-df-trace-ancestors]]；$\\operatorname{Slice},\\operatorname{Prefix},\\operatorname{Pattern}$ 见 [[56-df-position-slices]]。变量集记为 $\\mathcal V$，与有类型位置的顶点构造器 $V(p)$ 区分；假设 [[56-df-left-linear]] 的 $\\mathrm{LeftLinear}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V,R)$，其中 $\\mathcal V$ 实例化该节点的变量集 $V$。$\\phi\\in\\operatorname{PT}_R$，$s=S_R(\\phi)$，$t=T_R(\\phi)$，$P\\subseteq\\operatorname{TPos}(t)$。置换不变性和具体路径串行化分别见 [[56-lem-trace-permutation]]、[[56-lem-proofterm-serialization]]。"},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-116","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-lem-proofterm-serialization.md]]"},{"id":"efe12b141b93e7e9","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定正交系统。$\\rho\\in\\mathcal F_R$，$\\operatorname{Std}_R,\\operatorname{PStd}_R$ 见 [[56-df-standard-labelled-reduction]]；$\\operatorname{wit}_R,\\approx_R$ 分别取 [[56-df-proofterm-embedding]]、[[56-df-proofterm-permutation]] 的具体归约见证与置换等价。有限证明项的归约化见 [[56-lem-proofterm-serialization]]，SR测度及其良基性见 [[56-df-sr-measure]]、[[56-lem-sr-measure-well-founded]]；标准路径的单元素平行化保持标准性见 [[56-lem-standard-implies-parallel-standard]]。"}],"outgoing":["001b6ab17e88507e","c273fed319bca9e3"]}